 ProcessToolWithTable;globalParms;list;n1;parms
⍝ Presents a list of any length and allows processing selected rows; defaults only
 globalParms←##.GUI.APLGuiGlobalParms.CreateDefaults
 globalParms.regKey←'MyApp'
 globalParms.caption←'My App'
 globalParms.icon←#.⎕NEW'Icon'(⊂'File'(GetFile'Sample.ico'))
 list←∪300⍴⎕NL-3
 list←list[⍋⊃list]
 list←list,,[0.5]↓#.APLTreeUtils.FormatDateTime⊃{⍵[;1]}⎕AT list
 parms←##.GUI.ProcessTool.CreateParms
 parms.colTitles←'Name' 'Timestamp'
 parms.data←list
 n1←globalParms parms ##.GUI.ProcessTool.Create list'##.GUI_Demo.∆OnTestHandler_ProcessTool'
 ##.GUI.ProcessTool.ModalWait n1
